IN ACCORDANCE WITH ICAO RULES AND REGULATIONS IS THE HELLENIC
AVIATION SERVICE PROVIDER (HASP) THROUGH ITS APPROPRIATE AIS UNIT AND
THE ONLY RESPONSIBLE AUTHORITY FOR THE SAFETY OF THE AIR TRAFFIC IN
THE AREA IS THE HELLENIC AVIATION SERVICE PROVIDER (HASP) THROUGH THE
ATS AND ATC UNITS.
FURTHERMORE THE HELLENIC POSITIONS REGARDING THE SAID MILITARY
ACTIVITIES ANNOUNCED BY REF (B) TURKISH NOTAM A4816/26 EUECYIYN HAVE
ALREADY BEEN EXPRESSED IN THE REF (A) GREEK NOTAM A3970/26 EUECYIYN, 
WHICH IS THE ONLY VALID AND EFFECTIVE WITHIN ATHINAI FIR, AND THEY 
