E) GNSS OUTAGE:
   OCCASIONALLY GNSS SIGNAL JAMMING AND/OR POSSIBLE SPOOFING
   WERE ENCOUNTERED AND REPORTED BY ACFT OVERFLYING OR LANDING IN 
   BUCURESTI FIR. AIRCREWS SHALL EXERCISE CAUTION WHEN USING
   FLIGHT NAVIGATION BASED ON THESE SENSORS IN DIFFERENT 
   PHASES OF THE FLIGHT. IN BUCURESTI FIR CONVENTIONAL NAVIGATION
   INFRASTRUCTURE AVAILABLE. FOR MORE INFORMATION, ALSO CONSULT
   EASA SIB NO. 2022-02R4</description><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>25.5167,48.9167,0 26.474724146932203,48.85745023674761,0 27.403639214943478,48.68150122106504,0 28.275220589746013,48.394199074759314,0 29.06298571230788,48.00427332816401,0 29.742998738008435,47.523571677777504,0 30.294597815164956,46.9667,0 30.701022884940638,46.350578558970106,0 30.94992492725136,45.69392789290103,0 31.033741179492022,45.0167,0 30.94992492725136,44.33947210709897,0 30.701022884940638,43.682821441029894,0 30.294597815164956,43.066700000000004,0 29.742998738008435,42.509828322222496,0 29.062985712307885,42.02912667183599,0 28.275220589746013,41.63920092524069,0 27.403639214943478,41.35189877893496,0 26.4747241469322,41.17594976325239,0 25.5167,41.1167,0 24.5586758530678,41.17594976325239,0 23.629760785056522,41.35189877893496,0 22.758179410253987,41.63920092524069,0 21.97041428769212,42.02912667183598,0 21.290401261991565,42.509828322222496,0 20.73880218483505,43.0667,0 20.332377115059362,43.682821441029894,0 20.08347507274864,44.33947210709897,0 19.999658820507978,45.0167,0 20.08347507274864,45.69392789290103,0 20.332377115059362,46.350578558970106,0 20.738802184835045,46.966699999999996,0 21.290401261991562,47.523571677777504,0 21.970414287692115,48.00427332816401,0 22.75817941025399,48.394199074759314,0 23.629760785056522,48.68150122106504,0 24.558675853067797,48.85745023674761,0 25.5167,48.9167,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
