A) LTAA B) 2611110700 C) 2611151800
D) 11 0700-1000 1200-1500, 12 0600-0900 1200-1500, 13 1000-1300     
1500-1800, 14 0600-0900 1200-1500, 15 1000-1300 1500-1800
E) SEE NOTAM: A4938/26
RNAV ROUTES AND SEGMENTS AFFECTED DURING FIRING EXERCISE AS FLW:

1- AWY N/UN644 SIN-FALAZ SEGMENT CLSD.
ACFT THAT ARE GOING TO EXIT VIA ROLIN COULD FOLLOW 
MIMTO-DCT-CRM-DCT-TBN-DCT-ROLIN 
ACFT USING THIS ROUTE COULD FOLLOW VIA WESTBOUND 
ROLIN-DCT-TEMEL-DCT-CRM

2- AWY M/UM859 OSDIP-KARDE SEGMENT CLSD.
ACFT THAT ARE GOING TO EXIT VIA ROLIN COULD FOLLOW 
UDROS-DCT-CRM-DCT-TBN-DCT-ROLIN. 
ACFT THAT ARE GOING TO EXIT VIA REBLO AND NOLGA COULD FOLLOW 
UDROS-DCT-CRM-M/UM11-TBN.

3- AWY M/UM10 ATVAM-GOKPA SEGMENT CLSD.
INSTEAD OF THIS ROUTE ALL ACFT COULD FOLLOW SARPI-N/UN37-TBN

