BAGHDAD FIR ARE EXCLUDED. THESE TRAFFIC'S AREA USAGE REQUESTS SHALL 
BE DECIDED UPON THE COORDINATION BETWEEN ANKARA ACC AND BIKIM.
THE PILOTS OF AIRCRAFT THAT ARE MAKING AVOIDANCE MANEUVERS OUTSIDE
THE AIRWAY OR UNABLE COMPLY WITH THE FLIGHT LEVELS, SHALL INFORM ATC
UNIT IMMEDIATELY. IN SUCH A CASE, FLIGHT WILL BE CONTINUED SAFELY 
WITHIN EXERCISE AREA BY MEANS OF CIVIL/MILITARY COORDINATION.
TRAFFIC FLYING ON AWYS R/UR21, M/UM860 AND UT334 SHALL MAKE
AVOIDANCE MANEUVERS TO THE WEST OF THE AWY IN ORDER TO AVOID FIRING
EXERCISE AREAS.
F) 17000FT AMSL G) 26000FT AMSL</description><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>41.5,37.83333,0 41.5,37.36667,0 42.5,37.36667,0 42.5,37.76667,0 41.5,37.83333,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
