A7492/26 NOTAMR A7485/26
Q)UNNT/QFAXX/IV/NBO/A/000/999/5501N08239E005
A)UNNT B)2610201000 C)PERM
E)REF AIP RUSSIA AD 2.1 UNNT-18, AD 2.22 FLIGHT PROCEDURES,
ITEM 4 PROCEDURES FOR VFR FLIGHTS.
READ INSTEAD OF PUBLISHED:
1. BEFORE DEPARTURE, THE FLIGHT CREW SHALL OBTAIN DEPARTURE
CLEARANCE ON FREQUENCIES  122.000 MHZ/133.800MHZ NOVOSIBIRSK-RADAR,
4712KHZ NOVOSIBIRSK-RADIO. DEPARTURE WITHOUT CLEARANCE PROHIBITED.
2. IF UNABLE TO ESTABLISH RADIO CONTACT WITH THE CONTROLLER:
- REQUEST CLEARANCE FROM FLIGHT CONTROL OFFICER VIA PHONE
  (383)-319-09-29.
- TRANSMIT THE INFORMATION ABOUT ACFT LANDING TO THE CONTROLLER
  OF PLANNING SUPPORT GROUP VIA PHONE (383)-319-09-54.
3. THE FLIGHT CREW SHALL TRANSMIT/REQUEST THE INFORMATION ABOUT
DEPARTURE DELAY, CHANGE OR CANCELLATION OF A FLIGHT PLAN SUBMITTED
EARLIER, AVAILABILITY OF PERMISSION FOR AIRSPACE USE TO/FROM THE
CONTROLLER OF PLANNING SUPPORT GROUP VIA PHONE (383)-319-09-54.</description><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>82.65,55.100033333333336,0 82.67523937051307,55.098767312751015,0 82.69971185552482,55.095007718398826,0 82.72267387096188,55.08886878364871,0 82.74342772760451,55.08053703692658,0 82.76134283002058,55.07026563414055,0 82.77587483688868,55.058366666666664,0 82.78658220053364,55.045201678610475,0 82.79313958312933,55.03117068147225,0 82.79534774192375,55.0167,0 82.79313958312933,55.00222931852775,0 82.78658220053364,54.988198321389525,0 82.77587483688868,54.975033333333336,0 82.76134283002058,54.96313436585945,0 82.74342772760451,54.95286296307342,0 82.72267387096188,54.944531216351294,0 82.69971185552482,54.938392281601175,0 82.67523937051307,54.934632687248985,0 82.65,54.933366666666664,0 82.62476062948694,54.934632687248985,0 82.60028814447519,54.938392281601175,0 82.57732612903813,54.944531216351294,0 82.5565722723955,54.95286296307342,0 82.53865716997943,54.96313436585945,0 82.52412516311134,54.975033333333336,0 82.51341779946637,54.988198321389525,0 82.50686041687068,55.00222931852775,0 82.50465225807626,55.0167,0 82.50686041687068,55.03117068147225,0 82.51341779946637,55.045201678610475,0 82.52412516311134,55.058366666666664,0 82.53865716997943,55.07026563414055,0 82.5565722723955,55.08053703692658,0 82.57732612903813,55.08886878364871,0 82.60028814447519,55.095007718398826,0 82.62476062948694,55.098767312751015,0 82.65,55.100033333333336,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark>
