TOW.
ENGINES ONLY TO BE STARTED-UP AND SHUT DOWN AT START UP POINT.
2.
- ACFT TOW FM STANDS 4-6 TO START-UP POINT 2 PROHIBITED WHILE
ACFT ENGINES BEING STARTED-UP AT START-UP POINT 3.
- ENGINES START-UP AT START-UP POINT 3 PROHIBITED WHILE ACFT IS
BEING TOWED FM STANDS 4-6 TO START-UP POINT 2.
- STAND 1A DESIGNATED FOR ACFT WITH WING SPAN NOT EXCEEDING 29M.
3. ACFT STAND 14A COMISSIONED:
